---
// Integrantes del equipo y misión del proyecto
---

<section class="py-12 sm:py-24 md:py-32 bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-bg relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-200" id="equipo">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-16 reveal-init">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4 sm:mb-5">
        Los creadores de <span class="text-slimergy-green">Slimergy</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted font-medium">
        Un equipo de estudiantes mexicanos comprometidos con democratizar el monitoreo energético en hogares de todo México.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Fotos del equipo en Innovatec -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8 mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      
      <div class="group relative rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[36px] overflow-hidden border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-app dark:shadow-none reveal-init">
        <img 
          src="/assets/img/team-booth.webp" 
          alt="Equipo Slimergy en Innovatec 2026" 
          width="600"
          height="400"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-48 sm:h-96 object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/85 via-black/30 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 sm:bottom-6 sm:left-6 sm:right-6 text-white">
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black">Innovatec 2026 — Exposición del prototipo</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1 font-medium">Industria Eléctrica y Electrónica</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[36px] overflow-hidden border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-app dark:shadow-none reveal-init reveal-d1">
        <img 
          src="/assets/img/team-cert.webp" 
          alt="Equipo Slimergy con reconocimiento" 
          width="600"
          height="400"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-48 sm:h-96 object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/85 via-black/30 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 sm:bottom-6 sm:left-6 sm:right-6 text-white">
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black">Constancia de participación oficial</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1 font-medium">Reconocimiento al proyecto Slimergy</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Misión y visión del proyecto -->
    <div id="mision" class="pt-6 sm:pt-10 mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12 reveal-init">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          Por qué existe Slimergy
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-card rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[36px] p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-app dark:shadow-none reveal-init flex flex-col justify-between transition-colors duration-200">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Misión</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slimergy-main dark:text-white mb-3 sm:mb-4">Lo que hacemos</h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slimergy-muted dark:text-slimergy-app-muted leading-relaxed font-medium">
              Desarrollar e implementar <strong class="text-slimergy-main dark:text-white font-bold">soluciones inteligentes</strong> de monitoreo eléctrico que transformen el consumo de energía en información <strong class="text-slimergy-main dark:text-white font-bold">clara y accionable</strong>, permitiendo a hogares y pequeños negocios tomar decisiones que <strong class="text-slimergy-main dark:text-white font-bold">reduzcan costos</strong>, <strong class="text-slimergy-main dark:text-white font-bold">optimicen recursos</strong> y promuevan un uso eficiente de la energía mediante <strong class="text-slimergy-main dark:text-white font-bold">tecnología accesible</strong> e <strong class="text-slimergy-main dark:text-white font-bold">innovación continua</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slimergy-dark-card dark:bg-slimergy-app-card text-white rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[36px] p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slimergy-dark-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-dark-float dark:shadow-none reveal-init reveal-d1 flex flex-col justify-between transition-colors duration-200">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-green uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Visión</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3 sm:mb-4">Hacia dónde vamos</h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 dark:text-slimergy-app-muted leading-relaxed font-medium">
              Ser la principal <strong class="text-white font-bold">alternativa tecnológica</strong> frente a los proveedores tradicionales de electricidad en México, liderando la transición hacia un <strong class="text-white font-bold">modelo energético descentralizado</strong>. Posicionar a Slimergy como referente de <strong class="text-slimergy-green font-bold">soberanía energética</strong>, empoderando a hogares y negocios para tomar el <strong class="text-white font-bold">control absoluto</strong> de su consumo con innovación, autonomía y eficiencia.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tecnologías utilizadas en el desarrollo -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slimergy-app-card rounded-2xl sm:rounded-[28px] p-5 sm:p-8 border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border shadow-app dark:shadow-none text-center reveal-init transition-colors duration-200">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5">
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">ESP32</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">PZEM-004T</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">MQTT</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">React Native</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">Zustand</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">HiveMQ</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">Expo SDK 50</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">CFE DAC 2026</span>
        <span class="px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-slimergy-bg dark:bg-slimergy-app-sub border border-slimergy-border dark:border-slimergy-app-border text-xs font-bold text-slimergy-main dark:text-white">Arduino IDE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
